  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "エネルギーの　つまった　おおきい　アメ。\nレベル３０　いじょうの　ポケモンの\nとくこうを　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "에너지가 가득한 큰 사탕.\n레벨 30 이상인 포켓몬의\n특수공격을 올린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "充滿能量的大糖果。\n能提高等級在30以上的\n寶可夢的特攻。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un gros bonbon plein d’énergie.\nIl augmente l’Attaque Spéciale d’un Pokémon\nde niveau 30 ou supérieur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein großes Bonbon, das voller Energie steckt.\nErhöht dauerhaft den Spezial-Angriff eines Pokémon\nab Level 30.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Caramelo energético grande que aumenta el Ataque\nEspecial de un Pokémon de Nv. 30 o superior.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una caramella piena zeppa di energia.\nAumenta l’Attacco Speciale di un Pokémon\ndi livello 30 o superiore.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A big candy that is packed with energy. When given to\na Pokémon at Lv. 30 or higher, it will increase that\nPokémon’s Sp. Atk stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "エネルギーの　つまった　大きい　アメ。\nレベル３０　以上の　ポケモンの\nとくこうを　上げる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "充满能量的大糖果。\n能让等级30以上的\n宝可梦的特攻上升。",
